1
00:00:03,401 --> 00:00:07,946
Wall cabinets use the same editor. Open W1.

2
00:00:07,946 --> 00:00:25,231
Make it 30" wide, 30" high and 12" deep.

3
00:00:25,231 --> 00:00:34,894
Wall cabinets have a full top and bottom and adjustable shelves.

4
00:00:34,894 --> 00:00:59,190
W2 goes over the sink: 36" wide.

5
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:15,612
For a pantry, add any cabinet and change its Type to Tall.

6
00:01:15,612 --> 00:01:39,805
Pantry: 24" wide, 84" high, 23-1/4" deep, with four shelves.

7
00:01:39,805 --> 00:01:50,309
Open it again and the 3D view fits the whole 84" pantry.

8
00:01:50,309 --> 00:01:56,566
Done. The job now has four bases, two wall cabinets and a tall pantry.
